{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some thing Evol is afoot...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EVOL is a retro-inspired pixel art platforming adventure game packed with precision jumps, chaotic battles, and strange friendships.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665610/extras/Discriptions_1.png?t=1746548774\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate handcrafted levels full of tight platforming challenges, battle corrupted goop in intense spawn-and-lock fights, and befriend a cast of quirky animal characters as you uncover the mystery behind a creeping corruption threatening to consume the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665610/extras/Discriptions_EggHouse.png?t=1746548774\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls, Walk, Run, Jump, Dash, &amp; use your Sword to save your world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate tight platforming with precision jumps and dash &amp; wall jumps, the danger is always present.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be Spawned and Locked in, with tight battles that you will need to fight your way out of.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The different animal villages are all having issues with this null goo. You have made it your mission to void this null.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every animal has an Idol. Can you find them all? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665610/extras/Discriptions_Tree.png?t=1746548774\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665610?t=1746548774","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665610?t=1746548774","capsule_